- Balancing changes;

Hi all, we just released update 1.9.1, this new update contains:

[list]
[*] New limited edition Green Santa Headgear;
[*] Now all up air attacks have more endlag;
[*] Added new effects for several attacks and spawn effect;
[*] Now rewarded ad rewarding the player properly with the right currency;
[*] Fixed several crashes;
[/list]

We will now fully focus again on our biggest update 2.0.0, coming the start of next year :D

Hi @all, you can download update 1.8.0 now for Steam, Android and iOS!

The new update contains: 
- A new legend joins the battle, Tonatiuh! Tryout this new Aztec Warrior now;
- Special Halloween headgear;
- Grab attacks are now more frames active;
- Dynamic KO angles on attacks;
- Random character now resulting in a new random character on rematch;
- Fixed a bug when the player has a white name.

Our focus now is to work on Athena, the goddess of Wisdom and War!

Enjoy the game

Update 1.7.0 is out now! We have add a lot of cool new features to the game:

- Grab >>> to counter shield we have added grab into the game. You have a normal grab and a run grab!

- Spectate mode >>> it is now possible to spectate a friendly match. You can spectate by going to multiplayer > friendly and click on the button spectate. If the match is already ongoing, then you will need to go to main menu > friends > click on your friend > click on the spectate button. There is a limit of 16 persons that can spectate a match. Spectators will NOT cause lag during a match because your are connected to our server. 

- Rejoin >>> it is now possible to rejoin for Ranked and Friendly when you have a disconnection or other problem. Just go back to multiplayer mode and you will see a button poppin up to rejoin your last session.

- Land lag is added to the game;

- AI improvements;

- Performance improvements;

We will now focussing to add more content to the game. Next step is to add the Aztec warrior “Tonatiuh” into the game in 3 weeks from now!

We just released 1.6.1 with a lot of fixes and improvements, these are the changes:

Improved Edge guard options;
- Buffer for combo;
- Fixed lightning and collisions for Fallen Temple;
- Better login/logout flow;
- Balancing changes;
- Fixed chat and friends list

Happy rumbling everyone. We’ll start working now on our new and first Echo fighter: an Aztec warrior, details will follow shortly and a counter to shield!
